Need to update your password for security or personal reasons? No problem — Beat22 makes it quick and easy to change your password directly from your account settings. Follow this step-by-step guide:

1.  **Log in to Your Account** Visit [beat22.com](https://beat22.com) and sign in with your current email and password.
2.  **Click on Your Profile Icon (Top Right Corner)** After logging in, click on your **profile icon** at the top-right of the page.
    
    ![Click on Your Profile Icon (Top Right Corner) After logging in, click on your profile icon at the top-right](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184159.png)
    
3.  **Go to “Settings”** In the dropdown menu, select **“Settings”** to open your account preferences.
    
    ![Go to “Settings” In the dropdown menu, select “Settings” to open your account preferences.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-184217.png)
    
4.  **Scroll to the “Change Password” section** You’ll find a section labeled **Change Password**.
    
    ![Scroll to the “Change Password” section You’ll find a section labeled Change Password.](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-185806.png)
    
5.  ****Enter the required details**** Enter your **current password.** Enter your **new password.** Confirm your ****new password****
    
    ![Enter the required details Enter your current password. Enter your new password. Confirm your new password](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-185916.png)
    
     
6.  **Click “Change Password”**

Once updated, your password will be changed instantly and securely. **Forgot Your Password?** If you’re locked out of your account or can’t remember your password, go to the **Login Page** and click **“Forgot Password”**. We’ll send you a reset link via email. **Pro Tip:** Use a strong password that includes letters, numbers, and symbols for maximum security.
